          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বৈষম্য — boishômyô — \"discrimination; inequality\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মেয়েদের সঙ্গে বৈষম্য করা অন্যায়। meyeder sôngge boishômyô kôrā ônyāy. Discriminating against girls is wrong."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বৈষম্য (boishômyô) is Sanskrit vaiṣamya, unevenness (Monier-Williams), from viṣama 'uneven'. Bengali uses it for unequal treatment; it is done with -এর সঙ্গে."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
