          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অন্তর্ভুক্ত করা (ôntôrbhuktô kôrā) is a learned compound of Sanskrit antar, within, with bhukta, eaten or enjoyed (Monier-Williams), so 'taken in', and করা: to take someone or something inside a group. The compound itself is not in the dictionary."
